Subject: Cantor Current Evidence Manifest Rehash Repair Plan

@ [plan_uuid] e1f9db7d-7e1f-4ef7-9761-35a46ed3f4d7
@ [canonical] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_Current_Evidence_Manifest_Rehash_Repair.sop

& [RepairPlan] is sequential
  + [step_1] capture source, fault, rehasher, pre-repair status, current manifests, frozen hashes, and VerifyOnly count
  + [step_2] validate phase lock and claim EMRR-I01
  + [step_3] run the pinned rehasher once without VerifyOnly and invoke no evidence builder or probe
  + [step_4] inspect every changed path and field class; reject nonmanifest or frozen changes
  + [step_5] run VerifyOnly and require zero stale records
  + [step_6] run directly affected evidence tests followed by full workspace tests
  + [step_7] record exact manifest count, reference count, diff, tests, residuals, solution, proof, review, commit, and push

& [StopRules] are immediate
  + stop on a cycle, missing or nonportable artifact, frozen drift, unexpected file, unsupported field mutation, physical probe pressure, stale remainder, or authority ambiguity
  + a test failure may be diagnosed but never hidden
